    mnemonic: "Nurse = 6 hours",
    notes: "Lasts up to 6 hours, or until a doctor able to use Section 5(2) arrives, whichever is earlier. Context power for officers — useful to understand when called to a hospital. Police have no role in exercising it but may be asked to assist with an absconding patient.",
